{"server":"cn","storyId":"act11d0_level_act11d0_05_end","groupId":"act11d0","stageId":"act11d0_05","title":"冬灵挽歌","storyCode":"TW-5","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act11d0/level_act11d0_05_end.txt","sourceHash":"5b9389a8784968ae14e95d0ce6a0f1050790da96bb41824626b52d8b67c5bfd4","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"九尾狐活动 5下"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铃兰","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"快！这边走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢、谢谢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铃兰","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"亚叶姐姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"丽萨！你带着平民先走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"这群暴徒......他们在无差别攻击街道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！我们好不容易才抢下这玩意，你倒是射准一点啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"闭嘴！要操纵这玩意儿哪有那么简单！得亏我以前在音乐学院学习过——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"哪门子学院！？喂，宪兵！不要轻举妄动，我们有人质的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者B","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"人质在哪儿呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者A","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"*莱塔尼亚粗口*！街上在跑的不都是吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"啧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"亚叶小姐！不能让他们继续破坏下去了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"这附近的房屋都是木质结构，这样下去整片街道都会化为火海——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"火！快灭火！其他人赶紧离开这里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"还有很多来不及撤离的平民，我们得帮他们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"但这不是完全没法靠近吗——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"——呃，这火力！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"亚叶小姐！麻烦你照顾伤员！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亚叶","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽固的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"你们这些冬灵人！感染者！蛀虫！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽固的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么要烧了我的家！为什么！明明是我们养着你们的——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"小心头顶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽固的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽固的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......呃，塔佳娜？你、你还好吗！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......我还好，他们控制不住那些自律施术单元，这里很危险！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽固的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"我们一起反抗！把他们赶出去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"现在——还不是时候——！呃——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顽固的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"你的脚——！好、好吧，我听你的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"离开这里！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"（脚踝的刺痛......是骨折了吗？真糟糕......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"（得快点和其他人汇合......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"你这，贵族的爪牙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"——！？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......全部撤离了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铃兰","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"塞弗林长官，受伤的人很多，这里人手不够......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"医生们，听这位沃尔珀小姐的话，没受伤的年轻人也都去帮忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_065","isRemote":false,"text":"知道了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铃兰","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"如果亚叶姐姐在的话......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"等等......她们没有回来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"喂！亚叶和塔佳娜呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"她们、她们好像还在十二音街道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"——我刚才问的不是“全部撤离”吗！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"噫！对、对不起！但是，亚叶和塔佳娜应该不会有事的，他们救下了那么多人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"叛乱者抢占了城防设施，没有正规武装力量的她们怎么才能没事——咳咳，咳咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"——咳，找几个身强力壮的，和我去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"但是他们有火力优势，说不定已经有了人质，我们不应该再去刺激他们了，我们应该等着谈判的机会！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"机会！等着敌人给我们机会！你上过战场吗！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"对、对不起！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"但他的担忧不无道理。大裂谷留下的活性源石极有可能残留在沃伦姆德的地基内，任由他们破坏，后果不堪设想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"你们从哪里进来的！无关人士赶紧离开这里！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"没有宪兵队的我们倒更像无关人士......我见过你一面，罗德岛的干员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"感谢理解，断崖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"断崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"......简单的现场判断，如果他们继续用那种装置轰炸街道，十分钟到半小时沃伦姆德就会搁浅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"断崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"最好的处理方法是切断这片街道与城区的链接，但沃伦姆德不比移动城邦，街道缺乏自主移动的动力源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"其实拖拉机可以做得到......前提是，街道上没有那么多叛军。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"武装介入城镇事务需要申请手续吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......请便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"也请二位......务必救出塔佳娜和亚叶小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铃兰","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"塞弗林长官——这里还需要——啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......丽萨？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铃兰","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"是......是灰喉前辈？这位是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"断崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"干员断崖，天灾信使莱恩哈特的护卫，他本人有别的任务，我就被拖来这里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"丽萨，安托和亚叶呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铃兰","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"亚叶姐姐还在里面！安托......安托姐姐，那个......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"不用勉强，我明白了，只是确认一下......一会再说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铃兰","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"......呜呜......有、有罗德岛的前辈们来帮忙真是太好了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铃兰","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"——不、不行，现在还不能松懈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"铃兰","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"我会照顾好伤员的，请一定要把亚叶姐姐救回来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我会的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltalley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"断崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"那么小的孩子......也是干员？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅比丽萨大不了几岁，别忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"断崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"......原来如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"断崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"这场营救完全在计划之外，没有任何防护设备，你没问题吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"断崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"——真意外，传闻中的灰喉小姐并不是个能热情地迎接源石的人，我还担心过来着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"......我只是不想惨剧发生太多次，救人要紧，闲话少说吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事，怎么还有人敢冲进来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"武装的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_067","isRemote":false,"text":"这两个人动作好快！快、快解决他们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"断崖","speakerId":"char_294_ayer","isRemote":false,"text":"有不少本地人，没关系吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰喉","speakerId":"char_367_swllow","isRemote":false,"text":"尽量避开要害，动手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_294_ayer","aliases":["断崖"]},{"speakerId":"char_345_folnic","aliases":["亚叶"]},{"speakerId":"char_358_lisa","aliases":["铃兰"]},{"speakerId":"char_367_swllow","aliases":["？？？","灰喉"]}]}
